{
    "background_story": "Cason was a new father who unexpectedly found himself taking on a unique role. When his wife, Sarah, struggled to breastfeed their newborn daughter, Emma, due to medical complications, Cason stepped in to help. He became Emma's primary caregiver, learning everything there was to know about breastfeeding support and bottle-feeding. As Sarah recovered, Cason continued to be a rock for the family, helping with feedings, burpings, and soothing Emma's cries. His selfless dedication allowed Sarah to focus on her health, and eventually, she was able to breastfeed again. Cason's experience not only deepened his bond with Emma but also gave him a newfound appreciation for the challenges and rewards of breastfeeding. He became an advocate for breastfeeding support, helping other new parents navigate the journey.",
